{"In Delete(), the context is set with klog.NewContext(ctx, d.Log) instead of klog.NewContext(ctx, log), so the enriched logger is not embedded in the context": 0.9674509167671204, "In Update(), when d.Storage.Update() fails, d.recordLegacyDuration() is called instead of d.recordStorageDuration(), corrupting observability data": 0.9923296570777893, "DualWriterMode3.Delete records Storage duration using the object name in the metric's 'kind' label, causing unbounded metric cardinality and incorrect aggregation by kind": 0.9868367910385132, "DualWriterMode3.DeleteCollection records the legacy delete-collection duration using recordStorageDuration instead of recordLegacyDuration, so legacy timings are missing and storage metrics are polluted": 0.9928337335586548, "DualWriterMode3.Update passes the original rest.UpdatedObjectInfo to the legacy async update after Storage.Update, allowing legacy to compute a different updated object than what was persisted to unified storage": 0.8097006678581238, "SetDualWritingMode never transitions into Mode3 when desiredMode is Mode3, so instances configured for mode 3 will remain stuck in mode 1": 0.05105935409665108, "All async goroutines in mode3 derive their context from the parent request context which may be cancelled when the HTTP request completes, interrupting the legacy write": 0.9377679228782654}